Task 1: Update Outage Report with TIGO Composite Status
1. Name
Add TIGO Composite Status Breakdown to Outage Report
2. Description
Enhance the Outage Report by introducing a TIGO Composite Status Breakdown, similar to the existing Equipment Status Breakdown.
Additionally, include an indicator in the asynchronous Outage Verification report to identify whether TIGO analysis was included or excluded in the verification request.
3. Change Description
Update the existing Outage Report to provide a detailed breakdown of TIGO composite statuses and improve visibility into whether TIGO analysis was requested for each asynchronous outage verification request.
4. Change Details
Introduce a TIGO Composite Status Breakdown similar to the existing Equipment Status Breakdown.
Display the following metrics for each TIGO composite status:
Count
Minimum execution time
Maximum execution time
Mean execution time
Median execution time
Add a new TIGO Analyzed column to the asynchronous Outage Verification report.
Display:
true – TIGO analysis was included in the verification request.
false – TIGO analysis was excluded from the verification request.
Task 2: Update Outage Report with TIGO Analysis Information
1. Name
Enhance Outage Verification Status Breakdown with TIGO Analysis Information
2. Description
Update the Outage Report to differentiate outage verification statistics based on whether TIGO analysis was performed.
The report should provide separate status breakdowns for outages with and without TIGO verification while retaining the existing aggregated pie chart.
3. Change Description
Enhance the existing Outage Verification Status Breakdown to provide separate execution statistics for TIGO-analyzed and non-TIGO-analyzed outages.
This will help distinguish the verification performance and status distribution between the two categories.
4. Change Details
Split the existing Outage Verification Status Breakdown into two categories:
TIGO Analyzed = TRUE
TIGO Analyzed = FALSE
Display the following metrics separately for both categories:
Count
Minimum execution time
Maximum execution time
Mean execution time
Median execution time
Include the following outage statuses:
SUCCESS
FAILED
QUESTIONABLE
INVALID
QUEUED
PENDING
Retain the existing pie chart as an aggregated representation of both categories.
Ensure the existing overall outage statistics remain unchanged.
